1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,200
One Chinese character hides all eight basic strokes.
一个字，藏着八种笔画

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
It's 永 — the word for "eternity."
这个字是"永"，永恒

4
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,000
Master its strokes and you can write them all.
会写它，就会写万字

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,400
This is Chinese calligraphy — 2,000 years old.
中国书法，两千多年

6
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,800
Not just writing — it's painting with a brush.
不只写字，是用笔作画

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,200
It takes the Four Treasures of the study.
讲究文房四宝

8
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,600
Double-tap if you'd try holding the brush.
想提笔试试的点赞

9
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:21,000
Brush, ink, paper, and inkstone.
笔、墨、纸、砚

10
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,200
Every line shows the writer's own character.
字如其人，见性情

11
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:26,200
★ Expert Tip: at parks, try 地书 — giant strokes brushed on stone with plain water.
内行提示：公园试写地书

12
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:28,600
Would you write 永 — or just watch?
你想写"永"字吗？评论见
